// Dedushka demo: he rises from dormancy west of Morton (Everon), walks through
// the main row of houses and out the east side. Standalone experiment mission
// (not a Guerrilla template). The garrison and the townspeople are placed here,
// not made by script, because only a group loaded from a mission has its flee
// strength computed (the roar feature's notes). Everyone is EAST or civilian
// and the creature is held captive, so nobody has anyone to shoot at: the runs
// stay quiet. Written by hand from nothing; init.sqs makes the creature.
